shots_01_05.png", "id": "1277816534168609", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499311585_1277816537501942_3154844657831561670_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YWa20ZvOKTEQ7kNvwE7NPwn&_nc_oc=AdpthHMeg0rlzwJ000U2Rc945D1RgszvGy1aQMdKY13DBhFxrdmh73pJuWfQ5uTzl8s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2dQ3tA4l7S-goGes4QHPcjZ-XOhD2gqCYR0DetcuFjzQ&oe=69E235E0"}, {"file_name": "Wizherd_Screenshots_01_01.png", "id": "878339008156248", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304019_878339011489581_7260887061420950933_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=29j-Hib2mBkQ7kNvwGOiPRa&_nc_oc=Adp4ugq5IzaBj39W2CAbTMY3biq443aev_mrnAx3wibiYdBOXGi3FXnH-kszTshLMHM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1TIqSQBKAKTFvUyRhjRtBvxPQhp94wnfwVxQ376vsF1Q&oe=69E24817"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Wizherd_Keyart01_Landscape_Nic_1erPersonne_01.png", "id": "1674531227055534", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr8-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499309014_1674531230388867_6933805333205727927_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XmADbBXKij8Q7kNvwG_sfFQ&_nc_oc=AdryyLUMLlZEHY52RrlB_8P0tk8bW__W1wZS08MH6PA4ZDcmr0LatczLDpqNdtUSWPw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr8-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2qf2xPjoXU3Pc8oito9xarU37rFB1fjAO6_MFQkG-kKA&oe=69E248CF"}, "display_name": "Wizherd", "keywords": ["wizard", "magic", "free", "social", "fantasy"], "long_description": "                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         \n{914402764297709}\n# Master the Arcane. Conquer the Dungeons.\n\n# NEW! Fight through Endless Dungeon Mode to overcome waves of enemies to claim top spot amongst your friends. Can you prove to be best dungeon crawler in The Realm?\n\nWizherd is a fast-paced, dungeon-crawling VR adventure where you wield the magic. Sling powerful spells with your own hands, carve through waves of enemies, and face off against towering zone bosses!\n\n{2434305087019092}\n\nEquip unique spells, perks, and enchanted rings to shape your playstyle. Charge into battle solo or team up with friends for chaotic cooperative gameplay. Every run offers new dangers, new loot, and new ways to become a legendary spellcaster.\n\n**Key Features:**\n- \ud83c\udf0d Open World \u2013 Explore expanding environments and encounter smarter, deadlier enemies.\n- \ud83c\udff0 Explore Dungeons \u2013 Battle through 15 escalating difficulty tiers.\n- \ud83e\udd1d Co-op & Private Lobbies \u2013 Brave the chaos alone or with friends.\n- \ud83e\udde5 Wardrobe System \u2013 Customize your wizard\u2019s look with magical looks.\n- \u2728 Deep Magic Customization \u2013 Mix spells, perks, and ring buffs to master your craft.\n\nJoin the community, shape the future of the game, and experience the magic before anyone else. Wizherd is only getting stronger! ", "short_description": "Wizherd is a fast-paced, dungeon-crawling VR adventure where you wield the magic. Sling powerful spells with your own hands, carve through waves of enemies, and face off against towering zone bosses!\n\nNEW! Fight through Endless Dungeon Mode to overcome waves of enemies to claim top spot amongst your friends. Can you prove to be best dungeon crawler in The Realm?"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1269407838629598", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wizherd", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# Ma\u00eetrisez les arcanes. Conqu\u00e9rez les donjons.\nWizherd est une aventure VR effr\u00e9n\u00e9e d\u2019exploration de donjons o\u00f9 la magie est entre vos mains. Lancez des sorts d\u00e9vastateurs par vos propres mouvements, frayez-vous un chemin \u00e0 travers des vagues d'ennemis et affrontez d'imposants boss de zone !\n\n\u00c9quipez-vous de sorts uniques, d'atouts et d'anneaux enchant\u00e9s pour d\u00e9finir votre style de jeu. Foncez dans la bataille en solo ou faites \u00e9quipe avec des amis pour une exp\u00e9rience coop\u00e9rative chaotique. Chaque exp\u00e9dition offre de nouveaux dangers, de nouveaux butins et de nouvelles fa\u00e7ons de devenir un sorcier l\u00e9gendaire.\n\nCaract\u00e9ristiques principales :\n- \ud83c\udf0d Monde ouvert \u2013 Explorez des environnements en expansion et affrontez des ennemis plus intelligents et plus mortels.\n- \ud83c\udff0 Exploration de donjons \u2013 Combattez \u00e0 travers 15 niveaux de difficult\u00e9 croissante.\n- \ud83e\udd1d Coop et salons priv\u00e9s \u2013 Bravez le chaos seul ou entre amis.\n- \ud83e\udde5 Syst\u00e8me de garde-robe \u2013 Personnalisez l'apparence de votre sorcier avec des tenues magiques.\n- \u2728 Personnalisation magique pouss\u00e9e \u2013 Combinez sorts, atouts et bonus d'anneaux pour ma\u00eetriser votre art.\n\nRejoignez la communaut\u00e9, fa\u00e7onnez l'avenir du jeu et faites l'exp\u00e9rience de la magie avant tout le monde. Wizherd ne fait que gagner en puissance !", "short_description": "Wizherd est une aventure VR effr\u00e9n\u00e9e d\u2019exploration de donjons o\u00f9 la magie est entre vos mains. Lancez des sorts d\u00e9vastateurs par vos propres mouvements, frayez-vous un chemin \u00e0 travers des vagues d'ennemis et affrontez d'imposants boss de zone !"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://curlyblue.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://curlyblue.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "CurlyBlue LTD.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://curlyblue.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "821934236779161"}, {"id": "